==English==
{{wp|Percy (disambiguation)}}

===Etymology===
{{der|en|nrf|-}} baronial surname from a place in Normandy (Percy-en-Auge), {{der|en|fro|Perci}}, {{der|en|LL.|Persiacum}}, from the {{w|Gallo-Roman}} personal name ''[[Persius]]''.

